Listed below are all the '''special abilities and effects''' in [[The Battle Cats]]. The effects of some abilities can be improved by getting the [[Fruit Treasures]], equipping certain [[Talent Orbs]] or the activation of certain [[Cat Combo]]s.

==Attack Types==
Attack Types determine how and when a unit attacks. All characters have either Single Attack or Area Attack.

===Single Attack===
Units with this ability will only damage the closest target in their attack range. If two or more targets are at the same distance, a random one takes the damage.

