===Knockback===
Units with this ability can push enemies of specific traits back, while enemies will push back all cats. The ability has a set chance to activate and varies between units. This effect is completely separate from the "''Knockback''" caused by %HP loss (or "''Stagger''" in technical terms), as well as flinching caused by the default [[Cat Cannon]], Holy Blast and Sniper the Cat. It will also be overwritten by said "''Knockback''" ("''Stagger''") effect if both are caused by the same attack.

The animation of a knockback lasts for 11 frames, and units don't have a hitbox for the duration of it. The default knockback distance is 165 distance and the [[Fruit Treasures]] increase the knockback distance by up to 30% (214.5), while [[:Category:Sage Enemies|Sages]]' resistance reduces it by 70%. By contrast, damage-based knockbacks have 24f immunity and 345 distance, default [[Cat Cannon]]/[[Sniper the Cat]] knockbacks have 11f immunity and 55 distance, and boss shockwave knockbacks have 47f immunity and approximately 735 distance.

This ability is affected by '''"Knockback" Cat Combos'''.

The Breakerblast Cannon has this effect as well.

