===Dodge Attack===
:''This ability was added in [[Version 8.9 Update|Version 8.9]].''
Cats with this ability have a chance to take no damage from an enemy of a specific type and become immune to attacks from all targeted types for a set amount of time thereafter, while enemies will simply dodge any attack and become immune to all damage sources. When a unit successfully dodges an attack, a small yellow shield icon will briefly appear beside them, which disappears after their immunity ends. If a unit is hit by multiple opposing units on the same frame, the game will check each hit in unit spawn order until Dodge is triggered. Any damage from checks that failed to trigger Dodge will still be taken, but any checks made after Dodge triggers will be nullified. This can cause a unit to take damage and possibly die to a targeted enemy despite Dodge triggering. Dodge may also activate from [[Wave Attack|Waves]], [[Surge Attack|Surges]], and [[Explosion|Explosions]] that they are immune to, despite not taking damage from the attack. The [[Fruit Treasures]] increase the duration of the effect against certain enemy traits by 20%.

The Behemoth Slayer ability also has this effect, but does not target enemies by trait, instead protecting the unit from [[:Category:Behemoth Enemies|Behemoths]] when it activates. Since Behemoth Slayer is not considered a trait-specific ability, it isn't affected by Curse like the normal Dodge Attack.

Every second copy of a unit deployed with a Dodge Attack [[Talent Orbs|Talent Orb]] has a 1-10% chance to dodge attacks from all enemies for 1 second, including non-standard types like [[:Category:Typeless Enemies|Typeless]], [[:Category:Witch Enemies|Witch]] and [[:Category:EVA Angel Enemies|EVA Angel]]. Units with pre-existing Dodge Attack abilities will have both theirs and the Orb's as entirely separate abilities.

[[:Category:Cats with Conjure ability|Units]] with the [[Special Abilities#Conjure|Conjure]] ability can spawn a kamikaze unit once per cycle, which despawns after attacking, but has 100% chance to dodge all attacks. This ensures it cannot perish to enemy fire and will always function properly.

