===Drain===
:''This ability was added in [[Version 15.3 Update|Version 15.3]]''.
Exclusive to enemies, an enemy with the Drain ability's attacks have a set chance to increase the target's ongoing cooldown by a listed percentage of its current cooldown, delaying the time until they can be redeployed. The effect stacks additively if the attack hits multiple of the same cat; for instance, if two of the same cat are hit by an attack with a Drain effect of 50%, their cooldown progress will be fully regressed. The ability is indicated by the attack producing a blue vortex effect and a unique sound effect.

Cats that are currently available to deploy (i.e., not on cooldown) will not be affected.

As of [[Version 15.6 Update|15.6]], only two enemies have this ability, them being [[Sage of Selection Darvin]] & [[Marquis Clionius]].

