==Neutral Abilities==
Abilities in this section are listed next to '''Ability''' (能力, ''Nōryoku'') in the filter - excluding enemy-specific abilities. Neutral abilities work against '''all''' enemy types when applicable (with the exceptions of Metal Killer, Colossus Slayer, Behemoth Slayer, Sage Slayer, Witch Killer and EVA Angel Killer, which do not "target" them in the same way as Effects), and therefore are not disabled by Curse.

