===Barrier===
:''This ability was added in [[Version 6.5 Update|Version 6.5]].''
A [[Barrier]] is a defensive ability exclusive to certain [[:Category:Starred Alien Enemies|Starred Aliens]]. Enemies with Barriers are protected by a red, rhombus-shaped crystal which fully blocks all attacks that are weaker than its limit, and can only be normally broken by one blow with power greater than its limit. An animation of the Barrier materializing and flashing is shown when an attack of insufficient strength hits the Barrier, and another one of the Barrier cracking and falling apart when it breaks. When a Barrier is destroyed, the attack that broke it is still considered blocked and has no effect on the unit, unless the attack was from a Barrier Breaker. Attacks of insufficient strength cannot affect the protected unit in any way, including debuffs that the attack would have inflicted.

Each enemy with this ability has a different Barrier limit. As of [[Version 15.0 Update|15.0]], [[Youcan]] and [[UltraBaaBaa]] are tied for the toughest Barrier limit, at 266,000, while [[Corporal Weyland]] has the lowest at 2,500. The Barrier includes damage-related effects during damage calculation, such as Massive Damage, Savage Blow, etc, although any effects with visual effects will not show them.

The health of Barriers, unlike that of [[Shield]]s, is '''fixed''' and doesn't change with strength magnification.

