Shields also regenerate with a specific percentage of their maximum HP when their users suffer a damage-based knockback, unless it dies in that hit. Every enemy has a different maximum Shield HP and regeneration percentage upon knockback; unlike Barriers, Shield HP also scales proportionately to enemy strength magnifications.

